  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgarakrral.com%252fgeckos-curseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5a2ad07cdd3d023576c418dbc8e130125fb58428_0.webp\" alt=\"banner\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c9dfb13492de6bb8ee5aa48311bd56baeeb9ddae.jpeg\" alt=\"Replace this with a description\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgarakrral.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"Website\">\n  </a>\n  <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n  <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\">\n  <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\">\n  <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\">\n   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.garakrral.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/documentation/issues_vector.svg\" alt=\"Issue Tracker\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<h2>關於：</h2>\n<p><strong>Structures+</strong> 是一個數據包，為您的世界增添了新的結構，並作為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fstructures-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structures</a> 模組的延續。</p>\n<p>新增的結構不僅外觀精美（好吧，以我的能力來說 :D），還能為遊戲增添深度。我們的目標不是隨機生成毫無意義的結構，而是讓世界感覺更加豐富和沉浸式。此外，這些新增的結構是獨一無二的，在原始的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fstructures-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structures</a> 模組中並不存在。</p>\n<h2>注意事項：</h2>\n<p>此數據包已作為模組發布，這意味著您可以在 Neoforge、Forge、Fabric 和 Quilt 等模組載入器上使用它，並支援廣泛的版本範圍。</p>\n<p>該模組仍在積極開發中（並未放棄）。請記住：我可以添加、移除或更改任何關於結構的內容！</p>",
